  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Immediate draw down services for coordinated economic response by African governments. The offer includes technical assistance and analytical capability on how to manage the COVID-19 crisis from a multi-disciplinary perspective with a focus on delivery capability of Coordination Units and Central Crisis Units.</narrative>
  </description>
